From: engine <engine@diegonmarcos.com>
Date: Fri, 3 Jul 2026 11:08:02 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?comms:=20JMAP=20R8=20=E2=80=94=20dontwarn=20org?=
 =?UTF-8?q?.joda.convert.**=20(joda-time=20transitive)?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Next R8 batch: joda-time (transitive via the JMAP deps) references joda-convert
compile-only annotations. Standard -dontwarn.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 app/proguard-rules.pro | 5 ++++-
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/app/proguard-rules.pro b/app/proguard-rules.pro
index 80c256b30d..923933d9e7 100644
--- a/app/proguard-rules.pro
+++ b/app/proguard-rules.pro
@@ -172,4 +172,7 @@
 # library's model classes/members intact.
 -dontwarn lombok.**
 -keep class rs.ltt.jmap.** { *; }
--keepclassmembers class rs.ltt.jmap.** { *; }
\ No newline at end of file
+-keepclassmembers class rs.ltt.jmap.** { *; }
+# joda-time (pulled transitively by the JMAP deps) references joda-convert's
+# compile-only @FromString/@ToString annotations — not present at runtime.
+-dontwarn org.joda.convert.**
\ No newline at end of file
-- 
2.44.2

